         <div type="edition" xml:lang="tel-Latn">
            <p>
              <lb n="1"/>svasti śrī paṭṭapināṁṭṭi visi<lb n="2" break="no"/>kuṟiki paṟuṇḍu ma<unclear>ṭa</unclear>mva vē<unclear>yu</unclear><lb n="3" break="no"/>ratō koni pō<unclear>yeṅka śrī jē</unclear>namaha<lb n="4" break="no"/>ntadhavalunr̥patu dhanirāsim i<lb n="5" break="no"/>ccinaṇḍu
            </p>
