        <div type="bibliography">
          <p>
           The text was edited together with a second inscription on the same stone by H. Krishna Sastri in <bibl rend="omitname"><ptr target="bib:KrishnaSastri1925_01"/><citedRange unit="page">414</citedRange><citedRange unit="item">1128</citedRange></bibl> without a picture. The text was re-published by K. M. Sastri (<bibl rend="omitname"><ptr target="bib:Sastri1969_01"/><citedRange unit="page">345</citedRange><citedRange unit="item">98</citedRange></bibl>) on basis of SII with one error and without translation.	   
